    "title": "Music Rap Time Battle",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfb6 Friday night comes again! Music game will never get old \ud83c\udfb6\r\nThis time, set your time free 'cause it will drive you insane with an amazing game experience!\r\n\r\nMusic Rap Time Battle has numorous trendy orginal songs and mods waiting for you to play FULL WEEK! Feel free to play this exciting game - use multiple skills to beat your opponents \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaf How to play \ud83d\udcaf\r\n\u25b8 Tap the music arrow when it reaches the scoring area.\r\n\u25b8 Feel the beat, try not to miss any arrows\r\n\u25b8 Try to challenge harder songs as you can\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaf Game Features \ud83d\udcaf\r\n\u25b8 Full 7 weeks and many MODs updated weekly\r\n\u25b8 Hottest mods characters \r\n\u25b8 Hundreds of catchy song await\r\n\u25b8 Re-designed characters and animation \r\n\r\nKeep pushing for higher scores! Try it now!",
